WEBVTT

00:10:28.388 --> 00:10:31.989
another woman might hear me
and see me and recognize

00:10:32.013 --> 00:10:35.604
that none of us are the nothing
the world tries to tell us we are.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:37.668
In one hand,

00:10:37.692 --> 00:10:40.716
I hold the power to accomplish anything.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:41.741
And in my other,

00:10:41.765 --> 00:10:45.449
I hold the humbling reality
that I am just one woman.

00:10:45.918 --> 00:10:47.597
I am a bad feminist,

00:10:47.621 --> 00:10:49.263
I am a good woman,

00:10:49.287 --> 00:10:51.662
I am trying to become better
in how I think,

00:10:51.686 --> 00:10:53.946
and what I say, and what I do,

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:56.755
without abandoning everything
that makes me human.

00:10:57.152 --> 00:10:59.676
I hope that we can all do the same.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.943
I hope that we can all be
a little bit brave,